# Both Dockerfiles COPY only the Cargo workspace. Everything else in this
# checkout (benchmarks, profiles, sibling toolchains, local build output) sent
# ~7.4GB of context per build; exclude it so the daemon receives what it uses.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!ocrd-rust
!snapbot
ocrd-rust/target
ocrd-rust/target-*
ocrd-rust/bin
snapbot/target
